# Testing and Git Rules

- Inspect git status before making changes.
- Keep changes small, scoped, and reviewable.
- Do not commit automatically.
- Suggest concrete tests to run after changes.
- Do not normalize line endings without a dedicated task.
- Do not edit generated or cache files unless explicitly requested.
- Report the modified file list at the end of each task.
- Before creating a new docs/agent_tasks file, check whether an existing related file should be updated.
